{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They didn\u2019t come in peace\u2026 They came to BALL. Aliens have invaded Earth and they only want one thing: to dominate in basketball. And they\u2019re doing so in their own style, taking to the court in UFOs armed with powerful tractor beams. Time to start your hover engines and get ballin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally with friends in head-to-head or chaotic team matches in this physics based arcade sports game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/11e611a1da14091510eb282b00b8f67e.poster.avif?t=1764955917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/11e611a1da14091510eb282b00b8f67e.webm?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/11e611a1da14091510eb282b00b8f67e.mp4?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Low Floor, High Ceiling</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFO Jam is easy for anyone to hop in and start slam-jamming their way to a win. The real game starts when you and your friends master the UFO and start shooting like superstars with Jaxx Blorgin\u2019s patented tractor-beam physics system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/f35acf49177936a8ab655ffce1c155e1.poster.avif?t=1764955917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/f35acf49177936a8ab655ffce1c155e1.webm?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/f35acf49177936a8ab655ffce1c155e1.mp4?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Changing Power-ups</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling like you can\u2019t get a leg up on the competition? Get back in the game with a league approved missile launcher or any of the other power ups that add a touch of spice to your standard game of cosmic b-ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/d204574f701a4f0006936209502ba0a0.poster.avif?t=1764955917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/d204574f701a4f0006936209502ba0a0.webm?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/d204574f701a4f0006936209502ba0a0.mp4?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Around the World Tour</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunny Mexico to deep space, slammin\u2019 and jammin\u2019 knows no borders. Challenge your friends on five different courts, each with their own hazards, layout and flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/5dd0e20d179ef001ed6e39d46f0fa222.poster.avif?t=1764955917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958600/extras/5dd0e20d179ef001ed6e39d46f0fa222.webm?t=1764955917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea